d the old \"Observatory\" version as-is so it lives in git history. Then I swapped in the new \"Cosmos\" design and deleted the lab sims, the project pages and most of a 6k-line stylesheet.","2/3 The new home page is the fun part: a WebGL black hole hero (with a 2D fallback), warp jumps between sections as you scroll, a little terminal, an aim-check mini-game and an easter egg. I also added /simple, a plain résumé page for anyone who just wants the facts.","3/3 The rest of the night was small cleanup: Cloudflare Workers config, swapping the heading font from Syne to Archivo, and pointing the résumé and thesis links at GitHub instead of keeping PDFs in the repo. I also took Fibly off the site."]}}}}
